# The working tree stays LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git's autocrlf hands Windows a CRLF checkout while Prettier is
# configured to write LF, so `npm run format:check` fails on a clean clone here
# and passes in CI — the worst kind of disagreement to debug.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ttf binary
*.jks binary
*.hbc binary
